{"code": 0, "msg": "成功", "data": {"id": 169159, "game_id": 1069, "entry_id": 111538, "uid": 87565, "type": 4, "title": "WB介绍", "tag": "2", "created_at": 1665710589, "updated_at": 1666404407, "updated_uid": 87565, "comment_at": 1676444395, "last_at": 1680836479, "comment_count": 4, "status": 1, "summary": "前言一、WB是什么二、为什么要参加WB三、怎玩好WB世界BOSS大大大一、WB是什么1、WB是指世界巨型首领（WorldBoss）的缩写。2、这是一种20名天子同时参加战斗的一种玩法，所以3倍速一般手", "thumb": "//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/w_1080/h_2340/1069/87565/2022/9/14/68445.jpg,//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/w_1080/h_2340/1069/87565/2022/9/14/793156.jpg,//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/w_1080/h_2340/1069/87565/2022/9/14/126679.jpg", "model_ids": "", "like_count": 8, "unlike_count": 0, "view_count": 30110, "is_top": 0, "content_type": 0, "is_del": 0, "del_at": 0, "del_uid": 0, "is_release": 0, "source": 1, "last_ip_area": "", "is_prohibit_reply": 0, "is_only": 0, "state": 0, "audit_uid": 0, "favorite_count": 2, "seo": "", "video": "", "vote_ids": "", "is_elite": 0, "is_admin": 0, "audit_state": 0, "chat_game_id": 0, "is_image_text": 0, "from_chat": false, "chat_top": 0, "entry_auto": 1, "audit_at": 0, "server_id": 0, "image_num": 0, "video_list": "", "is_emulator": 0, "editor_type": 0, "ignore_hot": false, "mj_quote_num": 0, "mj_task_id": 0, "limit_age": 0, "important_at": 0, "is_expired": 0, "last_like_at": 0, "version": "", "word_count": 0, "content_id": 169159, "content": "<div contenteditable=\"false\" class=\"title-model-wrapper title1\"><div contenteditable=\"true\" class=\"title-p\"><span style=\"font-size: 24px;\">前言</span></div></div><div style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 20px;\"><br></span></div><div style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 20px;\">一、WB是什么&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;二、为什么要参加WB&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;三、怎玩好WB</span></div><div style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 20px;\"><br></span></div><div style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 20px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\">世界BOSS大大大</span></span></div><div style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 20px;\"><br></span></div><div style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 20px;\"><div contenteditable=\"false\" class=\"title-model-wrapper title2\"><div contenteditable=\"true\" class=\"title-p\" style=\"text-align: left;\"><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:20px;text-align:center;\">一、WB是什么&nbsp;</span></div></div><br></span></div><div style=\"text-align: left;\"><span style=\"font-size: 20px;\"></span></div><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\"><div style=\"text-align: left;\"><span style=\"\">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;</span><span style=\"\">1、WB是指世界巨型首领（World Boss）的缩写。</span></div><span style=\"line-height: 1.5;\"><div style=\"text-align: left;\"><span style=\"\">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;2、这是一种20名天子同时参加战斗的一种玩法，所以3倍速一般手机会卡。</span></div><div style=\"text-align: left;\"><span style=\"\">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;3、WB有五种属性每年平均5到7次，频率属于所有活动最少一类。</span></div><div style=\"text-align: left;\"><span style=\"\">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;4、WB的血量非常厚、多，没个玩家所造成的伤害全部加算到BOSS身上。</span></div><div style=\"text-align: left;\"><span style=\"\">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;5、所有伤害累加击败BOSS后全服务器的账号在活动期间都可以领一次击败奖励，并且有击败次数记录。</span></div><div style=\"text-align: left;\"><span style=\"\">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;6、门票自然恢复上限6张，每2个小时恢复一张，12个小时从0到6，一天12张，每次挑战可以当前挑战伤害，再次快速挑战三次（共消耗4张票），所以这个活动可以说算是平常玩家最休闲的活动。</span></div><div style=\"text-align: left;\"><span style=\"\">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;7、门票购买上限40次，每次3张，花费250钻石。每个小时可以看一次广告获得3张门票。</span></div><div style=\"text-align: left;\"><span style=\"\">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;8、WB不像RD有剧情副本，剧情一般需要在赫卡特的图书馆处购买。</span></div><div style=\"text-align: left;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(255, 0, 0);\">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;9、使用当期对策或加上，上期对策挑战世界BOSS，会增加BOOST值这个数值可以，在你造成的总伤害基础上，再次提升你的排名位置。</span></div></span></span><span style=\"line-height: 1.5;\"><div style=\"text-align: left;\"><span style=\"font-size: 20px;\"></span></div><div style=\"text-align: left;\"><span style=\"font-size: 20px;\"><div class=\"selectItem fold-model-container\" contenteditable=\"false\">\n                                \n                                <div class=\"fold-title-wrapper\">\n                                    <i class=\"icon-btn\"></i>\n                                    <div class=\"input-div\" contenteditable=\"true\">参考图片</div>\n                                </div>\n                                <div class=\"fold-content\" contenteditable=\"true\" style=\"display: none;\"><div class=\"div-img\"><img data-width=\"1080\" data-height=\"2340\" data-real=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/w_1080/h_2340/1069/87565/2022/9/14/68445.jpg\" src=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/w_1080/h_2340/1069/87565/2022/9/14/68445.jpg\"></div><div class=\"div-img\"><div class=\"div-img\"><img data-width=\"1080\" data-height=\"2340\" data-real=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/w_1080/h_2340/1069/87565/2022/9/14/793156.jpg\" src=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/w_1080/h_2340/1069/87565/2022/9/14/793156.jpg\"></div><br></div><div class=\"div-img\"><img data-width=\"1080\" data-height=\"2340\" data-real=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/w_1080/h_2340/1069/87565/2022/9/14/126679.jpg\" src=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/w_1080/h_2340/1069/87565/2022/9/14/126679.jpg\"></div></div>\n                               </div><br><br></span></div><div style=\"text-align: left;\"><span style=\"font-size: 20px;\"><div contenteditable=\"false\" class=\"title-model-wrapper title2\"><div contenteditable=\"true\" class=\"title-p\"><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:20px;text-align:center;\">&nbsp;二、为什么要参加WB</span></div></div><br></span></div><div style=\"text-align: left;\"><span style=\"font-size: 20px;\"></span></div><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\"><div style=\"text-align: left;\"><span style=\"\">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;1、为了整个服务器的击败奖励贡献一份力。</span></div><div style=\"text-align: left;\"><span style=\"\">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;2、为了自己可以多获得一些WB硬币，在WB商店消费。</span></div><div style=\"text-align: left;\"><span style=\"\">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;3、为了每日排行榜奖励和总结算排行榜奖励。</span></div><div style=\"text-align: left;\"><span style=\"\">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;4、为了蓝Pass任务5E伤害任务奖励</span></div><div style=\"text-align: left;\"><span style=\"\">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;5、大佬在天梯榜上连装带拿</span></div><div style=\"text-align: left;\"><span style=\"\">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;6、获得WB任务奖励</span></div></span><div style=\"text-align: left;\"><span style=\"font-size: 20px;\"></span></div><div style=\"text-align: left;\"><span style=\"font-size: 20px;\"><div class=\"selectItem fold-model-container\" contenteditable=\"false\">\n                                \n                                <div class=\"fold-title-wrapper\">\n                                    <i class=\"icon-btn\"></i>\n                                    <div class=\"input-div\" contenteditable=\"true\">参考图片</div>\n                                </div>\n                                <div class=\"fold-content\" contenteditable=\"true\" style=\"display: none;\"><div class=\"div-img\"><img data-width=\"1080\" data-height=\"2340\" data-real=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/w_1080/h_2340/1069/87565/2022/9/14/194014.jpg\" src=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/w_1080/h_2340/1069/87565/2022/9/14/194014.jpg\"></div><div class=\"div-img\"><img data-width=\"1080\" data-height=\"2340\" data-real=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/w_1080/h_2340/1069/87565/2022/9/14/808804.jpg\" src=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/w_1080/h_2340/1069/87565/2022/9/14/808804.jpg\"></div><div class=\"div-img\"><img data-width=\"1080\" data-height=\"2340\" data-real=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/w_1080/h_2340/1069/87565/2022/9/14/389386.jpg\" src=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/w_1080/h_2340/1069/87565/2022/9/14/389386.jpg\"></div></div>\n                               </div><br><div class=\"selectItem fold-model-container\" contenteditable=\"false\">\n                                \n                                <div class=\"fold-title-wrapper\">\n                                    <i class=\"icon-btn\"></i>\n                                    <div class=\"input-div\" contenteditable=\"true\">诡计多端的混子（卡在10点拿一会榜一）</div>\n                                </div>\n                                <div class=\"fold-content\" contenteditable=\"true\" style=\"display: none;\"><div class=\"div-img\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><img data-width=\"606\" data-height=\"1039\" data-real=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/w_606/h_1039/1069/87565/2022/9/22/460409.png\" src=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/w_606/h_1039/1069/87565/2022/9/22/460409.png\"></div></div>\n                               </div><br><br></span></div><div style=\"text-align: left;\"><span style=\"font-size: 20px;\"><div contenteditable=\"false\" class=\"title-model-wrapper title2\"><div contenteditable=\"true\" class=\"title-p\"><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:20px;text-align:center;\">三、怎玩好WB</span></div></div><br></span></div><div style=\"text-align: left;\"><span style=\"font-size: 20px;\"></span></div><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\"><div style=\"text-align: left;\"><span style=\"\">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;1、一般玩家来说肝也不会获得太多奖励，所以这个活动比较佛系。</span></div><div style=\"text-align: left;\"><span style=\"\">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;2、这并不是新手玩家的主要发力点，吃点全服奖励也挺好。</span></div><div style=\"text-align: left;\">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;<span style=\"color: rgb(255, 0, 0);\"> &nbsp;3、具体配队打伤害参考</span>《<a href=\"https://destinychild.gamekee.com/89833.html\">WB攻略分享贴</a>》</div><div style=\"text-align: left;\"><span style=\"\">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;4、由于游戏架构与机制问题，卡顿会造成伤害无法达到预期效果，BUFF没加上刷新技能和释放技能不及时，硬件计算数据没跟上。所以一般情况下。</span></div></span><div style=\"text-align: left;\"><span style=\"font-size: 20px;\"></span></div><div style=\"text-align: left;\"><span style=\"font-size: 20px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(177, 56, 206); text-align: left;\">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;设备配置越好伤害越高。伤害 1倍速 &gt; 2倍速 &gt; 3倍速。Mac &gt;= Ipad &gt; IPhone &gt;<span style=\"\">&nbsp;</span></span><span style=\"color: rgb(177, 56, 206); text-align: left;\">高配</span><span style=\"color: rgb(177, 56, 206); text-align: left;\">安卓 &gt; 高配台式模拟器 &gt; 低配安卓 &gt; 低配模拟器</span></span></span></div><div style=\"text-align: right;\"><span style=\"font-size: 20px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(177, 56, 206); text-align: left;\">——BY海洋饼干</span></span><span style=\"color:rgb(177,56,206);font-size:14px;text-align:left;\"></span><br></span></div><div style=\"text-align: left;\"><span style=\"font-size: 20px;\"><br></span></div><div style=\"text-align: left;\"><span style=\"font-size: 20px;\"><br></span></div><div style=\"text-align: left;\"><span style=\"font-size: 20px;\"><br></span></div><div style=\"text-align: left;\"><span style=\"font-size: 20px;\"><br></span></div><div style=\"text-align: left;\"><span style=\"font-size: 20px;\"><br></span></div><div style=\"text-align: left;\"><span style=\"font-size: 20px;\"><br></span></div><div style=\"text-align: left;\"><span style=\"font-size: 20px;\"><br></span></div><div style=\"text-align: left;\"><span style=\"font-size: 20px;\"><br></span></div><div style=\"text-align: left;\"><span style=\"font-size: 20px;\"><br></span></div><div style=\"text-align: left;\"><span style=\"font-size: 20px;\"><br></span></div><div style=\"text-align: left;\"><span style=\"font-size: 20px;\"><br></span></div><div style=\"text-align: left;\"><span style=\"font-size: 20px;\"><br></span></div><div style=\"text-align: left;\"><span style=\"font-size: 20px;\"><br></span></div><div style=\"text-align: left;\"><span style=\"font-size: 20px;\"><br></span></div></span><div style=\"text-align: left;\"><span style=\"font-size: 20px;\"></span></div>", "content_json": "", "content_cdn": "", "is_favo